# Note what is NOT here: traces/, posters/, a/*.html, animations.json and assets/ksl-animation.js are all
# generated, and all committed on purpose. This repository IS the published site — GitHub Pages serves
# these files straight from the branch, so anything ignored here is simply missing from the site.
#
# Regenerate them from a KSL checkout with:
#     ./gradlew -p KSLAnimationCore jsBrowserProductionWebpack
#     ./gradlew buildAnimationSite -Pout=../KSL-Animations

# macOS / Windows / Linux desktop droppings
.DS_Store
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Editors and IDEs
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~

# Local scratch: somewhere to drop a trace or a page while trying something, without it reaching the site.
scratch/
